# SpeakerAccuracyEvaluator writes `<output>.with-text.json` under
# `--include-text`; it contains transcript, reference, and Entry text and must
# never be committed. The text-free report path is user-chosen, so keep it out
# of the repository by hand.
*.with-text.json
